  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development of Maya people and the promotion of Canill culture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Alcalda Maya de Canill (AMC) will execute a planning grant to design a sustainability strategy for the organization. The grantee will participate in various training sessions to determine the most appropriate legal status for the organization, develop office management, fundraising, branding and negotiation techniques skills, and increase its knowledge of indigenous rights. The grantee will also visit other similar organizations in Guatemala to learn how they brand themselves and present themselves to national and international donors.</narrative>
  </description>
